Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part A}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:07.90,0:00:10.99,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Whoa! This is practically a {\i1}festival!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:12.53,0:00:15.83,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,I never knew the Mototokage race \N was {\i1}this{\i0} popular!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:15.83,0:00:20.17,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Yeah! And today’s the final day, \N so everyone’s {\i1}especially{\i0} excited!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.17,0:00:23.13,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Whoa! The real thing!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.26,0:00:30.09,Main,Smartphone Rotom,0,0,0,,Mototokage. Ride Pokémon. \N Dragon/Normal type.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.09,0:00:33.43,Main,Smartphone Rotom,0,0,0,,Apparently, it’s been letting people \N ride on its back since ancient times.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:33.43,0:00:36.85,Main,Smartphone Rotom,0,0,0,,Depictions of this have been found \N in murals from ten thousand years ago.{ENgame: Apparently Mototokage has been allowing people to ride on its back since ancient times. Depictions of this have been found in 10,000-year-old murals.}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.85,0:00:39.10,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,They’re {\i1}that{\i0} old?!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:46.53,0:00:48.95,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh? W-Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.49,0:00:52.12,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Geez, always the same story{/thing} \N with little kids...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.12,0:00:53.37,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:53.37,0:00:55.62,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,They’re selling ice cream here!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.62,0:00:56.49,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:56.49,0:00:58.12,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,I’m coming! I’m coming!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:58.12,0:00:59.37,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:58.12,0:00:59.37,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,{\an8}Good idea!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:01.12,0:01:03.50,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Hrrm...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.50,0:01:05.55,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,What do I pick...?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:05.55,0:01:08.46,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Ice cream’s nice, \N but so are sandwiches...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:08.46,0:01:10.93,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Masquernya, \N they’ve got matcha ice cream!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:11.97,0:01:14.26,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Ooh, it’s you lot.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:14.97,0:01:16.35,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,What a coincidence!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:16.35,0:01:18.27,Main,Liko Roy,0,0,0,,Ms. Raifort!{Raifort-sensei}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:18.68,0:01:21.02,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Are you here to \N watch the race too, miss?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:21.02,0:01:22.52,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Well, that too, but actually...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:22.52,0:01:27.78,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,{\q2}There’s a flea market open throughout the race days, \N so I’m on the prowl for old documents.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:28.23,0:01:31.28,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,And I’m in a good mood \N thanks to a lucky haul!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:31.28,0:01:33.66,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,So let me treat you \N to anything you’d like.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:33.66,0:01:36.28,Main,Kids,0,0,0,,{\i1}All right!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:45.71,0:01:46.42,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:49.71,0:01:51.30,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Colza-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:52.34,0:01:53.93,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Back in a minute.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:53.93,0:01:54.80,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,‘Kay!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:57.56,0:01:59.47,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Hey! That’s my—
Dialogue: 10,0:01:59.18,0:01:59.97,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,{\an8}Wah!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:59.47,0:02:00.77,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Ahh, sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:02.19,0:02:04.48,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Ult, you’ve got to be careful.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:04.48,0:02:05.69,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,You all right?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:06.31,0:02:08.36,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,I’ll just go... wash this off.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:08.36,0:02:10.40,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Yeah, we’ll wait for ya!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:10.40,0:02:14.36,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Huh? I thought he went this way...
Comment: 10,0:02:14.99,0:02:15.74,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Huh?
Comment: 10,0:02:33.30,0:02:33.80,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Comment: 0,0:02:59.70,0:02:59.70,Main,,0,0,0,,{Opening}
Comment: 0,0:04:29.79,0:04:29.79,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part B}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.80,0:04:48.60,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,It’s pretty large... \N Is this a Mototokage, too?
Comment: 10,0:04:49.31,0:04:50.44,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.10,0:04:53.06,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,You okay?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.36,0:04:56.61,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Maybe you’re not feeling well...?
Comment: 10,0:04:59.32,0:05:00.82,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.20,0:05:03.87,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.04,0:05:07.58,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Could that mean...?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.08,0:05:12.21,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Are you hungry?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.33,0:05:16.96,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Well? Wanna try some? It’s tasty.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.22,0:05:28.35,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Maybe it’s feeling weak...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.14,0:05:31.94,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Hey, it’s okay now.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.94,0:05:33.23,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.40,0:05:37.53,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.23,0:05:39.36,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Are you hungry?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.83,0:05:52.00,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Mmhm!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.54,0:05:54.46,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Here, it’s tasty!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.14,0:06:14.77,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Thank goodness! Have some more.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.11,0:06:18.69,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,They’re taking a long time...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.57,0:06:22.90,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Neither of them is picking up...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.90,0:06:25.20,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,The race is about to begin, too...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.20,0:06:28.20,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Ah well, we’ll just have to \N leave without them.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:29.49,0:06:33.96,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\q2}Mototokage, the Pokémon that has lived alongside \N Paldea’s humans since old times!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.46,0:06:39.96,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\q2}It enjoys giving rides to humans, and it is that very habit{trait} \N which led to the birth of our Mototokage Race.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.96,0:06:44.97,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,And {\i1}this{\i0} race, the 103rd, \N has reached its final day!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.38,0:06:49.97,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,For commentary, we have Hassaku-san \N of the Paldea League Elite Four in attendance.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.97,0:06:51.97,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Huh?! For real?!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.97,0:06:56.98,Main,Hassaku,0,0,0,,Who better to call upon for Dragon types?{When you say Dragon Type, [you think of] that's me!} \N I shall provide impeccable commentary!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.61,0:07:00.48,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,The course for the finals \N starts right here in Bowl Town,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:00.48,0:07:03.99,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,and heads through the South Area’s \N mountains and valleys to Cercle Town.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.99,0:07:08.74,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,From there, they’ll head east, \N setting their sights on the goal of Table City.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.12,0:07:11.79,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,You’re taking part in the race, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.79,0:07:13.25,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Where’s your trainer?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.92,0:07:18.25,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Let’s go to the starting line together!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:21.88,0:07:24.59,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,Currently in first place, \N defending their four-win streak,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.59,0:07:27.76,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,is Mover Foods, led by the champion, \N Competitor {Imblastinit}Tobashitenno!{Mover Foods is probably a play on Uber Eats, ムーバーフーズ vs ウーバーイーツ. ENgames renamed PokeMover to PokeTransporter}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.76,0:07:30.51,Main,Hassaku,0,0,0,,With the great man of the mountain stages, \N Competitor {Uppio}Noborio,{Nobo-rio, nobori=ascend}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.51,0:07:35.69,Main,Hassaku,0,0,0,,{\q2}and the stormy sprinter Competitor {Calm}Tyler, \N we can look forward to some finely coordinated racing!{taira = calm, tranquil, placid, composed, stable}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:37.60,0:07:40.69,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,On their tail are last year’s \N second place team, Paldea Postal.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.69,0:07:45.78,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,Followed by the first-time entrants \N from the Johto Region, the Dragon Biker Gang!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.78,0:07:48.24,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Huh? The Dragon Biker Gang?
Comment: 10,0:07:51.16,0:07:51.74,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.74,0:07:52.74,Main,Dorara,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.41,0:07:55.83,Main,Dragon Biker Gang,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ride on!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.79,0:07:58.42,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:59.21,0:08:01.42,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,And the Scovillain is out!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.42,0:08:05.67,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,The starting gun for the final stretch \N is finally about to fire!
Comment: 10,0:08:29.95,0:08:30.82,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.00,0:08:43.21,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Wha—?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.38,0:08:47.30,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.94,0:09:04.19,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,What?!
Comment: 10,0:09:07.11,0:09:07.69,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.99,0:09:13.37,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,What’s gotten into you?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.24,0:09:20.00,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,South Area 5 is a mountainous stage \N with large ups and downs!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.54,0:09:25.96,Main,Vincent,0,0,0,,I’ll break ahead! \N Mototokage! Gear Change!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.88,0:09:35.51,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,Paldea Postal’s mountain pro, \N Competitor {Paperand}Vincent, pulls ahead!{Binsento, binsen to = stationary and}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.51,0:09:36.39,Main,Hassaku,0,0,0,,What’s this?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.39,0:09:39.85,Main,Hassaku,0,0,0,,It seems someone else \N is joining the group!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.85,0:09:42.14,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,Could those be \N spectators’ Mototokage?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:42.60,0:09:44.15,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Liko?! Roy?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.15,0:09:46.86,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Hmm...? \N Could those Pokémon be...?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.86,0:09:47.53,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,After them!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.53,0:09:49.82,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Huh? What’s the rush...?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.82,0:09:52.07,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Beats me, \N but it sounds innerestin’!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.07,0:09:53.78,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.87,0:10:01.04,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Liko?! What’re you doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.04,0:10:01.87,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Roy!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.87,0:10:07.13,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,{\q2}I was just trying to bring this lost Mototokage \N back to the race, and it suddenly took off running...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.55,0:10:09.05,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:09.05,0:10:12.09,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,But it won’t listen to a thing I say...
Comment: 10,0:10:12.09,0:10:13.43,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.55,0:10:15.89,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,Hassaku-san, your thoughts?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.26,0:10:19.39,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,With surprise entrants in this leg, \N just what can we expect?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.39,0:10:25.35,Main,Hassaku,0,0,0,,{\q2}Compared to the mostly level grounds we saw yesterday, \N this course may be tough for the average Mototokage to run.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.90,0:10:30.99,Main,Hassaku,0,0,0,,However! I {\i1}do{\i0} get the feeling \N we may witness something unexpected here!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.96,0:10:45.25,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:45.25,0:10:46.29,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Settle down!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:50.42,0:10:51.96,Main,Liko Roy,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.96,0:10:55.47,Main,Liko Roy,0,0,0,,Waah!
Comment: 0,0:11:04.48,0:11:04.48,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part C}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.48,0:11:11.90,Main,Liko Roy,0,0,0,,Waah!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.87,0:11:30.00,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Amazing! We’re flying!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.14,0:11:47.27,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,That was a little scary, \N but it was really fun!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.90,0:11:50.77,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Have you settled down now?{same settle/calm as 10:45}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:54.03,0:11:55.78,Main,Liko Roy,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.66,0:12:07.29,Main,Liko Roy,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.54,0:12:11.67,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,When they started flying, \N I began wondering if...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:14.34,0:12:17.55,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,...maybe these {\i1}aren’t{\i0} \N Mototokage!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:19.47,0:12:21.30,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Liko! Roy!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:21.30,0:12:22.18,Main,Liko Roy,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:28.31,0:12:31.52,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Sorry for suddenly disappearing, \N Masquernya.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.23,0:12:34.82,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.82,0:12:37.15,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Ohh, I feel sick...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.57,0:12:41.07,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,There’s no doubt about it.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:41.07,0:12:45.37,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,This is Koraidon, \N said to be the ancestor of Mototokage.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.37,0:12:46.58,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Koraidon?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.95,0:12:50.75,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Yeah. I’ve seen only a single one before,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.75,0:12:53.79,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,but it’s a Pokémon that shouldn’t normally \N {\i1}exist{\i0} in the present day.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:53.79,0:12:55.34,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,But what brings it here?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:58.05,0:13:00.34,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,The other one \N I’ve never seen before...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.88,0:13:05.72,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Could it be Miraidon, \N of which only scant records remain?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.22,0:13:07.73,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Miraidon!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.74,0:13:27.54,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Koraidon! Miraidon!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:27.54,0:13:29.12,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Don’t fight!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:39.51,0:13:45.14,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\q2}The first ones to break through the harsh mountain roads \N of South Area 5 and reach the first checkpoint...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:45.14,0:13:47.68,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,...are, unsurprisingly, \N the top two teams:
Dialogue: 10,0:13:48.52,0:13:52.02,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,Mover Foods and Paldea Postal!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:00.11,0:14:04.78,Main,Kitte,0,0,0,,Tobashitenno-san, don’t you think it’s about time \N you handed over that red winner’s jersey?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:06.12,0:14:07.70,Main,Tobashitenno,0,0,0,,You never give up, {Stamp}Kitte.{Kitte=stamp}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.70,0:14:10.29,Main,Tobashitenno,0,0,0,,If you want it, you’ve gotta \N show your stuff and take it from me!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:10.29,0:14:14.04,Main,Vincent,0,0,0,,I’ll be taking that mountain prize jersey \N off you, Noborio!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:14.04,0:14:15.29,Main,Noborio,0,0,0,,If you say so!{Talk[imperative]! as in 'say whatever you want' 'you can keep saying that' 'go on, run that mouth of yours'}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:42.32,0:14:45.82,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh? Maybe they’re \N actually getting along...?{Huh? Maybe it's kinda a good [atmopshere/vibe]...}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.82,0:14:48.49,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Of course! I think I still have...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:50.08,0:14:51.08,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.08,0:14:52.12,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:52.12,0:14:53.25,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Me too!
Comment: 10,0:15:00.80,0:15:01.71,Main,Liko Roy,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:17.19,0:15:18.73,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,What a relief!
Comment: 10,0:15:18.73,0:15:20.07,Main,Dot Navi,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.07,0:15:21.86,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Have Navi’s too!{I'll give you Navi's too!}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:21.86,0:15:22.73,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,And mine!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.78,0:15:25.61,Main,Dot Navi,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.53,0:15:29.41,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,It ate it!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:29.41,0:15:31.49,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Have more and more! And this!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:31.49,0:15:33.79,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I’ve still got more for you!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:33.79,0:15:38.75,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Me and Yamirami ate all mine, \N so I don’t got nothin’ for ya!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:40.71,0:15:43.26,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Here. Go give them mine.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:43.26,0:15:44.55,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Comment: 10,0:15:44.67,0:15:45.42,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:47.30,0:15:50.60,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,I didn’t care one bit about \N joinin’ in though, you hear? Geez!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:05.57,0:16:07.78,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Are you saying \N we can ride you again?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.53,0:16:11.07,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,You want to race?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:12.53,0:16:16.50,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Go on and do it, kids! \N You won’t get this chance again!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:17.04,0:16:18.67,Main,Liko Roy,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:23.67,0:16:25.67,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Give it your best shot!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:26.59,0:16:30.64,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Now then, how about \N we meet them at the finish line?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:30.64,0:16:31.80,Main,Dot Ult,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.27,0:16:38.81,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,Now, the leading racers \N have entered Cercle Town.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:38.81,0:16:43.32,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,Once they leave the town and head east, \N they’ll finally be at their goal of Table City!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.32,0:16:45.44,Main,Spectator,0,0,0,,Go, go, Mover Foods!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:45.44,0:16:47.19,Main,Spectator,0,0,0,,Tobashitenno, blast it!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:47.19,0:16:48.95,Main,Keshiin,0,0,0,,Mototokage! Trailblaze!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:51.45,0:16:54.70,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,And Competitor {Postmark}Keshiin{Keshi'in = postmark} \N of Paldea Postal makes her move!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:54.70,0:16:57.04,Main,Tyler,0,0,0,,Not on my watch! Agility!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.70,0:17:00.58,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,But Competitor Tyler \N doesn’t miss a beat!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.58,0:17:02.46,Main,Hassaku,0,0,0,,She’s got her signed and sealed!{She has her perfectly marked[=watched].}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:02.46,0:17:05.05,Main,Tyler,0,0,0,,You’re not getting past me that easy.
Comment: 10,0:17:12.59,0:17:14.64,Main,Racers,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Comment: 10,0:17:14.64,0:17:15.51,Main,Racers,0,0,0,,Wah!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:15.93,0:17:16.81,Main,Hassaku,0,0,0,,Dra-gone!{ENgame: "GRRRAAAGH!" in one instance, "The mighty dragon has been felled!" in another}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.81,0:17:19.02,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,Oh my! A sudden accident!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.02,0:17:24.15,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\q2}Swerving to avoid a Puppymocchi that leaped out \N in front of them has led to a humongous crash!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:26.02,0:17:27.73,Main,Tobashitenno,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Mototokage?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:29.03,0:17:33.12,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,How will this time loss \N affect the race results?!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:33.12,0:17:34.03,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:34.03,0:17:36.54,Main,Dragon Biker Gang,0,0,0,,Honk-honk! Honk-honk!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:36.99,0:17:41.79,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,Astoundingly, the first-time entrants \N of the Dragon Biker Gang have caught up!{have reached this [point/location]!}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.79,0:17:46.17,Main,Neki,0,0,0,,We’ve come all this way to be here! \N We’re not leaving empty-handed!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:03.81,0:18:06.32,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,The race is almost over!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:06.77,0:18:10.28,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,Currently leading the pack is, unbelievably, \N the Dragon Biker Gang!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:10.28,0:18:15.57,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\q2}Right on their heels, the prior champions{ouja} Mover Foods, \N as well as Paldea Postal, are in hot pursuit!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:15.57,0:18:16.83,Main,Dora,0,0,0,,Let’s go!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:20.70,0:18:23.46,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,And the sprint for the finish \N has begun!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.46,0:18:28.84,Main,Hassaku,0,0,0,,This race will be decided by just how much \N the sprinters can distract the aces!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.84,0:18:35.22,Main,Spectator,0,0,0,,Paldea Postal!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:35.22,0:18:37.85,Main,Spectator,0,0,0,,Go! Dragon Biker Gang!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:41.43,0:18:42.23,Main,Dora,0,0,0,,Neki!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:42.23,0:18:43.60,Main,Neki,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.10,0:18:49.23,Main,Kitte,0,0,0,,I’ll show you \N the fastest delivery in Paldea!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:49.23,0:18:50.94,Main,Tobashitenno,0,0,0,,I am the unassailable champion{zettai ouja}!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:51.53,0:18:55.11,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,Will the glories of victory descend on \N Competitor Tobashitenno of Mover Foods?!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:55.11,0:18:57.37,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,Competitor Kitte of Paldea Postal?!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.37,0:19:01.54,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,Or possibly even Competitor Neki of \N the dark horse Dragon Biker Gang?!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:02.83,0:19:06.63,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,At last, they’re close enough \N that they might be seen by the naked eye!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.63,0:19:07.46,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:09.09,0:19:10.34,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,What’s this?!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:16.13,0:19:17.26,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Liko! Roy!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:17.26,0:19:18.39,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,This’s super intense!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:18.39,0:19:19.47,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Go for it!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.47,0:19:23.81,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,Amazing! The two surprise entrants \N from the start of the race...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.81,0:19:26.85,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,...are catching up with \N the frontrunners at an unreal pace!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:28.11,0:19:28.86,Main,Tobashitenno,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:28.86,0:19:29.86,Main,Neki,0,0,0,,You guys?!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.23,0:19:31.11,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Neki-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:31.11,0:19:32.61,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,It’s been so long!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.61,0:19:35.61,Main,Neki,0,0,0,,What’re those swanky dragons?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.61,0:19:40.62,Main,Hassaku,0,0,0,,Bwuuuh! {\i1}There{\i0} is the unexpected shock \N I’d longed to see!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:41.74,0:19:43.62,Main,Tobashitenno,0,0,0,,No surprise entrant’s beating me!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.62,0:19:47.12,Main,Kitte,0,0,0,,I’ll shred anyone who messes with me!{tear up: likely some kind of paper pun, though I couldn't find an exact source}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.13,0:19:50.71,Main,Neki,0,0,0,,Honk-honk! Honk-honk!
Comment: 10,0:20:02.64,0:20:03.85,Main,Liko Roy,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.03,0:20:26.79,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,Goal!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.50,0:20:37.97,Main,Announcer 2,0,0,0,,As of this moment, \N the 103rd Mototokage Race has concluded.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:37.97,0:20:40.47,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Ahh, that was fun!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:40.47,0:20:42.14,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,It sure was!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:42.14,0:20:45.10,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,We made some lovely memories \N with Miraidon and Koraidon, too. {Miraidon-tachi}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.10,0:20:47.39,Main,Neki,0,0,0,,You make pretty good bikers, y’know?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:48.06,0:20:50.06,Main,Neki,0,0,0,,Where did you find those Pokémon o—?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:50.06,0:20:54.27,Main,Hassaku,0,0,0,,Bwuuuh-huh-hoi-hoi-hoi-hoi-hoi-hoi...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:54.27,0:20:56.82,Main,Hassaku,0,0,0,,Everyone, that was a marvelous race!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:56.82,0:20:58.70,Main,Hassaku,0,0,0,,The bonds between man and dragon!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:58.70,0:21:03.37,Main,Hassaku,0,0,0,,This, truly, is the {\i1}epitome{\i0} of what \N the storied Mototokage Race should be!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.37,0:21:04.83,Main,Hassaku,0,0,0,,Uuuh...{crying}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:04.83,0:21:08.08,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Ooh, wise words from Mr. Hassaku.{Hassaku-sensei}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:08.08,0:21:11.71,Main,Neki,0,0,0,,Well, let’s race again \N next time we meet, you hear?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.21,0:21:13.46,Main,Dragon Biker Gang,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ride on!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:13.46,0:21:14.46,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:16.67,0:21:19.17,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Koraidon and Miraidon, huh...?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:19.17,0:21:21.05,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,I hope we meet them again.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:21.72,0:21:26.10,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,If you lot wish to see them, \N they’ll show themselves again.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:26.10,0:21:28.52,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,History repeats itself, after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:28.52,0:21:30.98,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Next time, I get to ride ‘em too, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:30.98,0:21:34.23,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Huh?! Wouldn’t that be up to {\i1}them?{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:34.23,0:21:36.44,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Navi’s hungry now!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:36.44,0:21:39.32,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Well, I might know a tasty \N paella restaurant!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:39.32,0:21:42.20,Main,Raifort,0,0,110,,Since we’ve come all this way, \N how about I treat you to dinner, too?{blah this covering up the To Be Continued, but splitting it is no good and it's very distracting to have it moved so far to the left to clear the sign. Putting it at the top is also a problem unless we put all the lines from this cut at the top, which feels excessive. - Toa}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:42.20,0:21:45.49,Main,Kids,0,0,0,,{\i1}All right!{\i0}
Comment: 0,0:21:45.49,0:21:45.49,Main,,0,0,0,,{Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie A}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.74,0:21:48.29,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Friede here!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:48.29,0:21:51.79,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,It’s time to Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:53.00,0:21:55.17,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Today’s topic is Miraidon!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:55.17,0:21:57.25,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,It has various different forms.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:57.25,0:21:59.38,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Its four-legged form is Limited Mode.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:59.38,0:22:01.51,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,So then, how about its floating one?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:04.09,0:22:06.47,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,See the answer after the commercials!
Comment: 0,0:22:06.47,0:22:06.47,Main,,0,0,0,,{Ending}
Comment: 0,0:23:36.48,0:23:36.48,Main,,0,0,0,,{Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie B}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:40.36,0:23:42.32,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Time to announce \N the correct answer!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:42.32,0:23:43.86,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,The answer is...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:43.86,0:23:46.24,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,C: Complete Mode!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:46.24,0:23:50.49,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,By keeping its foes in check from above, \N it can turn the battle in its favor!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:50.49,0:23:53.50,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,I wonder where those two went...{I wonder how far away those two went...}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:54.12,0:23:56.50,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,I hope they’re not fighting.
Comment: 0,0:24:00.50,0:24:00.50,Main,,0,0,0,,{Preview}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:01.59,0:24:04.09,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Let’s all play Squisher-Rules Karuta!{The Puni-ller Commandments Karuta}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:04.09,0:24:05.42,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:04.09,0:24:05.42,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,{\an8}Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:06.01,0:24:09.93,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,“To squish is a moment’s happiness, \N to squish not a life’s unhappiness.”{happy/unhappy are probably for closeness to JP haji/haji, 'to x, to x not' an attempt to sound old proverby/'to be or not to be'}{direct: To squish is a moment's Happy, to squish not is a lifelong Unhappy}{orig: To ask is a moment's haji(shame), to ask not is a lifelong haji(shame)}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:09.93,0:24:11.47,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,There, I got it!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:11.22,0:24:11.72,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,{\an8}Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:11.47,0:24:13.72,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,“A Squisher that trots about \N meets a squishy-squishy.”{from "The dog that trots about finds a bone.", most results are AI junk about Israel but seems to be a Romani proverb phrasing, that dates back to at least 1842}{direct: A Puni-ller(probably the squishy-otakus' name for themselves) meets a squishy-squishy if it walks}{orig: Even a dog finds[/gains/earns/gets hit by] a stick if it walks}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:13.72,0:24:15.56,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,There, I got it again!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:15.10,0:24:15.98,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,{\an8}Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:15.56,0:24:17.52,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,“Pretty as a squishy-squishy, \N graceful as a squishy—”{tried to keep the comparison structure + hint of things like 'pretty as a picture'; half a distorted idiom that names three different flowers when EN doesn't even distinguish two is a pain}{direct: When standing, a squishy-squishy['s visage], when sitting, a squishy--}{orig: A Chinese peony['s visage] when standing, a Chinese tree peony['s visage] when sitting, a lily's visage when walking}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:17.52,0:24:19.15,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,There! Got it yet again!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:18.90,0:24:19.69,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,{\an8}Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:19.15,0:24:22.48,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,And so, to be continued \N next time on Pocket Monsters!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:22.48,0:24:25.90,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,{\q2}Squishy Pokémon! \N When the Squish Gets Squisher, It’s Squish Time!!{hoping for 'readable/fitting if squisher -> together' (if that turns out to be right), with '-er' takeable as the suffix of 'comparatively more' for the idea of 'grammar stayed, meaning omitted', and also a hint of EN set phrases 'when the going gets tough' / 'it's go time'}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:25.90,0:24:27.99,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Hold on, \N I’m not following this {\i1}at all!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:27.99,0:24:30.45,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,What exactly {\i1}is{\i0} \N “Squisher-Rules Karuta”?!
